<title>UK: Three of four Brent cargoes kept on Friday.</title>
<headline>Three of four Brent cargoes kept on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three of four Brent cargoes nominated loading dates were kept on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>Glencore, BP and JP Morgan kept cargoes.</p>
<p>A fourth cargo was left unclaimed at the five o'clock deadline, the traders added.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
